 <h3><u>Jab Imam Aayenge</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=userContent>Haal e gham sunaenge jab Imam aayenge<br> zakhm Dil dikhaenge Jab Imam Ayenge<br> Mehfil e jamaaenge Jab Imam Ayenge<span class=text_exposed_show><br> Bamodar sajaenge Jab Imam Ayenge<br> Jashn Hum manaenge Jab Imam Ayenge<br> <br> Zakhm hai abhi taaza maqqa aur madeena ke<br> Sham o kufa karbobala hum bhula nahi sakte<br> Az sakheefa taai dam ghair se nahi pohche<br> Jitne dukh uthae hai humne kalma goyo se<br> Ek ek chukaenge.....x2<br> Jab Imam Ayenge<br> <br> Shak hai jinko allah ke adl aur adaalat par<br> Mansab e nubuwat par saiyada ki ismat par<br> Murtuza ki ahmed se mukhtasir niyabat par<br> Jinko Shak hai bara par baarwey ki ghaibat par<br> Sab hi maar khaenge....x2<br> Jab Imam Ayenge<br> <br> Naam par sahaba ke kaam kafiro jaise<br> Naam par sahaba ke kaam fasiqo jaise<br> Naam par sahaba ke kaam munkiro jaise<br> Naam par sahaba ke kaam mushriqo jaise<br> Sab hi muh churaenge...x2<br> Jab Imam Aenge<br> <br> Dawa e mohabbat jo subho shaam karte hai<br> Unke dushman o se bhi raao rasm rakhte hai<br> Khums bhi nahi dete gheebatei bhi karte hai<br> Momino se bhi dil me bughz o keena rakhte hai<br> Kistarah nibhaenge...x2<br> Jab Imam Aenge<br> <br> Jhut bolne ko hum mashwala samajhte hai<br> Baat baat par bejaa'n maslehat barakhte hai<br> Aur munafiqat ko bhi maslehat hi kehte hai<br> Lahmo laab ka saamaa'n hum gharo me rakhte hai<br> Kistarah chhupaenge....x2<br> Jab Imam Aenge<br> <br> Nemate shariyat ko bojh hi samajhte hai<br> Lahmo laab hi ko hum zindagi samajte hai<br> Saahebaan e zar ko bada aadmi samajhte hai<br> Tang dast momin ko bas yuhi samajhte hai<br> Kya maqaam paenge<br> Jab Imam Aenge<br> <br> Ye hamare mukro riya shatirana aiyari<br> Kya hamare saumo salaat aur yeh azadari<br> Kitna hai khuloos in me kis kadar riyakari<br> Kya imaam ki khatir hum ne ki hai taiyari<br> Kaise muh dikhaenge...x2<br> Jab Imam Aenge<br> <br> Al ajal jo kehte hai agae to kya hoga<br> Kya hai apni taiyari pesh hum karenge kya<br> Sibt e jafar apna to kul yahi hai sarmaya<br> Humd o naat o soz o salaam aur manqabat nauha<br> Ham yahi sunaenge...x2<br> Jab Imam Aenge</span></span></p> 
